e":"May 2016 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=B8A91D96_D0C0_4E8B_97B1_B2DB6E6A4785_082615.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"concall_transcript","date":"2016-01-01","title":"Jan 2016 Concall Transcript","url":"https://shreepushkar.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/Investors-Earnings-Call-transcript-1.pdf","source":"the data provider"},{"kind":"concall_ppt","date":"2016-01-01","title":"Jan 2016 Concall PPT","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=56F67B66_1F16_4B15_8B85_F1BE33AC66D5_154644.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2026","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/8287698d-5dd3-410d-bf78-1b84e8df3172.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2025","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/80f7954a-44a0-43a3-a2d9-d1e1623e3839.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2024","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/233b320d-9203-477a-b105-ea676409e6cd.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2023","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachHis/1c5caa00-27c3-4d9b-a2a0-25010a3602da.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/76662539334.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/70647539334.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/67327539334.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/5393340319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/5393340318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/5393340317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/539334/5393340316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2014/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2014.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/SHREE_PUSHKAR_CHEMICALS_&_FERTILIZERS_LTD-539334-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Shree Pushkar Chemicals & Fertilisers Limited reported a strong financial and operational performance for Q2 and H1 FY27, driven by sustained demand, improved realizations, and a favorable product mix. Consolidated revenue for Q2 FY27 reached INR403.5 crores, marking a 58.2% year-on-year increase, while EBITDA and PAT grew significantly. Management highlighted the commencement of commercial production at Unit 5 and a new 10 megawatt DC solar project at Nanded, alongside progress on ongoing expansion plans including Madhya Bharat Phosphates. For the full year FY27, management maintains a conservative revenue visibility of around INR1,250 crores to INR1,300 crores. Shree Pushkar Chemicals & Fertilisers Limited reported robust financial and operational performance for Q2 and H1 FY27, driven by strong growth in both Chemical and Fertiliser segments.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The management stated visibility of achieving at least INR1,250 crores of total sales with three-digit profitability for the full year.","quote":"In my opinion, if you ask me, we should be able to achieve at least INR1,250 crores of total sales and profitability should be in three digits.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management indicated that next year's revenue could be somewhere closer to near around INR2,000 crores with a possible 10% variation.","quote":"Sir, if I talk about next year, like 2027-2028, in my opinion, we should be somewhere closer to near around INR2,000 crores. Maybe a 10% variation could be also there.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects to achieve close to Rs. 1,250 crores in turnover with a PAT margin near 9% for FY27.","quote":"And the kind of visibility I gave in my last concall that in this particular financial year, the company would be achieving close to Rs. 1,250 crores turnover with the PAT levels of around near to the 9% or so.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that the turnover figure could potentially move toward Rs. 1,350 crores or Rs. 1,400 crores.","quote":"Sir still now, If I look at my visibility of Rs. 1,250 crores, that was in account with Units 5 and 6. I wouldn't be surprised if that figure moves toward Rs. 1,350 crores or Rs. 1,400 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that once Unit 6 comes into operation, a revenue of Rs. 1,700 or so will not be a difficult task.","quote":"If you look at a theoretical calculation, it would go somewhere to 2,000. But I believe once Unit 6 comes into operation, then 1,700 or so will not be a difficult task for us.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects Q2 to be much better than last year's Q2.","quote":"110% much better than last year Q2.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management noted that quarter three for fertilizers may remain a bit subdued.","quote":"And going forward, I see that quarter three, mainly because of a poor season in terms of fertilizers, it may remain a bit subdued.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management stated that global demand is still a bit weak.","quote":"Although we have started the plant, but overall, if you see, global demand is still a bit weak.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management observed that business is gradually returning to normalcy.","quote":"Sir, gradually business is coming back and as how stability is approaching to the business it is also coming back to normalcy, which is already proved from the results of what we did in quarter 2.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"Revenue growth was supported by sustained demand and improved business performance across the company's chemical and fertiliser segments.","quote":"During the quarter, Revenue from Operations stood at Rs. 403.5 Cr, registering a robust growth of 58.2% YoY, supported by sustained demand and improved business performance across the Company's Chemical and Fertiliser segments.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"Sales volumes across both businesses were lower during the quarter.","quote":"Against the backdrop, sales volume across both the business were lower during the quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Improved realization across both businesses helped offset lower volumes and supported sales value growth.","quote":"However, improved realization across both the businesses helped offset the impact of lower volume and supported growth in the sales value.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted that customers are gradually absorbing increased raw material prices into their business chemistry.","quote":"Slowly and gradually, whatever the increase into the raw material prices are there, now the customers have absorbed and certain customers are starting to absorb, those increased prices into their business chemistry.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Commercial production at Unit 5 commenced during the quarter, strengthening dye manufacturing capacity by approximately 6,000 metric tons per annum.","quote":"Moving to our operational developments, we are pleased to share that commercial production at Unit 5 of our company commenced during this quarter, strengthening our dye manufacturing capacity by approximately 6,000 metric tons per annum.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company invested INR92 crores in ongoing capex projects as of September 30, funded totally by internal accruals.","quote":"As on date, as on 30th of September, the Company has invested INR92 crores in the ongoing capex project, which has been totally funded by the internal accruals of the company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"The board approved a capex of INR70 crores for a new chemical plant at Unit 5, Lote Parshuram, with an additional capacity of 3,000 metric tons per annum, expected to be commissioned by March 2028.","quote":"In line with our growth strategy, the board has also approved a capital expenditure of INR70 crores for establishing a new chemical plant at Unit 5, Lote Parshuram, with an additional capacity of 3,000 metric tons per annum. The project is expected to be commissioned by March 2028 and is aimed at catering to the growing demand of our customers.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"Projects are underway at Ratnagiri units adding 1,50000 MTPA and 69,000 MTPA capacities across fertilisers and chemicals.","quote":"ProjectsunderwayatRatnagiriUnitsat6andnewProjectatUnit5adding1,50,000MTPAand69,000MTPAcapacitiesacrossFertilisersandChemicals","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"Unit 5 and Unit 6 at Ratnagiri are at an advanced stage of completion.","quote":"At Ratnagiri, Unit 5 and Unit 6 are at the advanced stage of completion, given the continued volatility in raw material prices and availability.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The expansion projects are expected to add 4,50,000 metric tons per annum of fertilizer capacity and 72,000 metric tons per annum of chemical capacity.","quote":"Together, these projects are expected to add 4,50,000 metric tons per annum of fertilizer capacity and 72,000 metric tons per annum of the chemical capacity additionally, significantly expanding the company's manufacturing base.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The company acquired about 30,000 square meters of additional land at Lote Parshuram for Rs. 9.33 crores.","quote":"During the quarter, the company acquired approximately 30,000 square meters of additional land at Lote Parshuram for Rs. 9.33 crores, located near the existing Unit 1.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"The 10-megawatt DC solar power project at Nanded is nearing completion and will take total installed solar capacity to 20.6 megawatts on a DC basis.","quote":"The 10 megawatt DC solar power project at Nanded is nearing completion and once commissioned, we will take the company's total installed solar capacity to 20.6 megawatt on DC basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Profit after tax increased by 96.1% year-on-year to INR35.7 crores with a PAT margin of 8.9%.","quote":"Profit after tax increased by 96.1% year-on-year to INR35.7 crores with a PAT margin of 8.9%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"Chemical segment margins improved mainly due to the China factor and shortages caused by compliance with environment and safety norms in China.","quote":"First of all, as far as the chemical space is concerned, the margins have improved mainly because of the China factor. In China, there is a huge shortage going on in terms of dye intermediates, mainly because of various compliances in terms of environment and safety norms in China.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA margin for the quarter was approximately 12.0%, reflecting an 88% growth.","quote":"From a profitability perspective, the Company delivered EBITDA of Rs. 50 Cr with an EBITDA margin of approximately 12.0%, reflecting a growth of 88 YoY.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA increased by 9.7% year-on-year to Rs. 31.9 crores with a margin of 11.4%.","quote":"EBITDA increased by 9.7% year-on-year to Rs. 31.9 crores with a margin of 11.4%, while profit after tax grew by 9.4% to Rs. 22.9 crores with a margin of 8.2%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross profit was Rs. 89.2 crores with a margin of 31.9%.","quote":"Gross profit was Rs. 89.2 crores, registering a growth of 6.3% year-on-year with the margin of 31.9%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"},{"claim":"Sulphur prices have risen from the range of USD 250-USD 300 to USD 1,100.","quote":"Specifically, if I talk about sulphur, sulphur, which used to be in the range of USD250-USD300, in today's date, only sulphur is in the range of USD1,100.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company's total installed solar capacity on a consolidated basis increased to 20.6 megawatt on a DC basis.","quote":"With this addition, the company's total installed solar capacity on a consolidated basis has increased to 20.6 megawatt on a DC basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The board approved the issuance of 8,54,060 fully convertible warrants to Mr. Punit Gopikishan Makharia at an issue price of INR526.90 per warrant, aggregating up to INR45 crores.","quote":"In this regard, the board has approved the issuance of 8,54,060 fully convertible warrants to Mr. Punit Gopikishan Makharia, Promoter and Chairman and Managing Director of the company, at an issue price of INR526.90 per warrant, aggregating up to INR45 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintains a comfortable liquidity position with Rs. 125 crores in non-lien deposits as of June 30, 2026.","quote":"From a liquidity perspective, the company continues to maintain a comfortable position with Rs. 125 crores in non-lien deposits as on June 30, 2026.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The company faced continued challenges around global supply chain and elevated raw material prices.","quote":"The performance was achieved despite continued challenges around global supply chain and elevated raw material prices.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=be92392e-6991-42c2-a85b-a3f8f8c930d5.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The new chemical plant at Unit 5 with an additional capacity of 3,000 metric tons per annum is expected to be commissioned by March 2028.","quote":"The project is expected to be commissioned by March 2028 and is aimed at catering to the growing demand of our customers.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf","timeframe":"March 2028"},{"claim":"The company plans to bring in the balance money for the preferential issue before March 2027.","quote":"So probably we will be getting it before March 2027, the balance.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=360c31cd-66ae-4977-b7d3-555d0936f44a.pdf","timeframe":"March 2027"},{"claim":"The new chemical plant project at Ratnagiri Unit 5 is expected to be commissioned by March 2028.","quote":"The project is expected to be commissioned by March 2028 and is aimed at catering to the growing demand from customers.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=bfe1f304-b834-4e6c-9f8c-e3127102fa19.pdf","timeframe":"March 2028"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":34,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":11,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}